# /docs — the repo's spec folder at the ROOT, anchored.
#
# This was a bare `docs`, which in an ignore file matches a directory of that
# name at ANY depth. It therefore excluded app/docs/ as well, and the docs page
# built perfectly on this machine while 404ing in production: the route was
# never uploaded. Nothing in the build output said so, because from Vercel's
# side the file simply did not exist.
